{"v":4,"catch":"以勝利的SENKYU KING為目標！","desc":"「SENKYU」是SEIBU KAIHATSU於1995年推出的一款益智遊戲。\n遊戲玩法是將四個或四個以上相同顏色的球連接起來，然後將其消除，形成四個或四個以上相同顏色的球鏈，以爭取高分。\n除了可以判斷自己實力的SKILL TESTER MODE之外，還可以參加「SENKYU」錦標賽，在NORMAL MODE中爭取勝利或與其他2名玩家對戰。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2025-03-21","genres":["益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/33e073f9858ed8a054e148d89ea9ee42a3ef8057e5db2e6828d0f1f809d01ddc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/67a2f930f80e4141a30e6ada2ff0a7f8f38f09cb6ad91f4e7436e704cb3a1e08.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5fa0e3467c59c3a3e5ea09ea8a2952626279243552d9238fcc9aacc0920b09fd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/036a5ab174ba26225a8b0da256ad2ca82df5f722ae960e6d18de0843517364c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2e6e9ab67f2816a432899584d93fdc5447c5072c79f92a3f111ce67524054c50.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e518b6f0bbfcf21ba0d918f95f4aff6a80349dc10bb94b2506f1ec61b9e259cd.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a3e02142e000","dlc":[]}